29:T3768,<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-7015 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/employer-brandings.jpg" alt="" width="617" height="415" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Social media is now like the unsaid part of evolving, learning and drawing an image. Many brands have thereby increased their brand presence online on various social media platforms and continue to choose the medium, as a form of communication. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">In addition to this, the competition for acquiring the right talent is cutthroat in the market with several possibly good candidates. But how does a candidate choose your organization? Yes, </span><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/employer-branding-agency"><span data-contrast="none">Employer b</span></a><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/employer-branding-agency"><span data-contrast="none">randing</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> plays the key role here. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Employer branding is basically promoting your organization to your employees, thereby giving them an idea of the culture, goals, vision and how the organization works. This particularly highlights what&#8217;s it like to work in a certain organization. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Social media, being the most popular and easiest form of communication, plays a crucial role in portraying your organization before the future hires of the company. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<h2 aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="none">Here Are the Top 5 Ways to Use Social Media for Employer Branding in 2024: </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:160,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}"> </span></h2>
<h3 aria-level="3"><span data-contrast="none">Video Content </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:160,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}"> </span></h3>
<p><a href="https://www.hrmorning.com/articles/social-media-reshaped-hiring/"><span data-contrast="none">According to an article</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">, around 90% of job seekers state that a company’s social media page impacts their decision whether they choose to apply for the company or not.  Employees now expect more clarity on the culture, goals and how well the organization performs to make informed decisions before joining. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Video content helps visualize and portray an image of the company culture, teamwork, events and celebrations, creativity, and a reason to connect and understand the organization clearly. This helps the future hire to take an overview of the functioning and visualize themself within a particular company. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/diwali-marketing-takeaways-5-inspiring-diwali-campaign-ideas-to-watch/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Diwali Marketing Takeaways: 5 Inspiring Diwali Campaign Ideas to Watch</a></p>
<h3 aria-level="3"><span data-contrast="none">LinkedIn Presence</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:160,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}"> </span></h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Gone are the days when people would choose an organization based on traditional methods. In the past it was all about face-to-face interactions or personal references/contacts. However, now the tables have turned with changing demands and expectations of the employees. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">LinkedIn displays and gives an overview of your organization’s professional goals, corporate honors, updates, employee achievements, employer mindset and professional outlooks etc.  Maintaining an active LinkedIn with regular posting is extremely essential to mark your achievements as an organization and build professional connection. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/make-linkedin-business-page-awesome/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn Business Page – Tips to make it more awesome</a></p>
<h3 aria-level="3"><span data-contrast="none">Meme Marketing for Potential Audience</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:160,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}"> </span></h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">“Every regular thing can be done in a creative way”, be it hiring a new candidate, celebrating a win at work, relatable situation pov, various office situations. Memes are a great form of communication serving as a quick, humorous, and meaningful way to connect with the audience.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">It also helps you subtly draw attention to what you&#8217;re trying to communicate, offering a humor touch to it. Your meme creation will also give an idea about your creativity, building a forefront image before the future hires or anyone visiting your brand page.  It helps understand how updated you are and your willingness to get creative. It also helps draw attention and be well known, a lot of us know of various companies through a variety of their reels itself.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/can-you-use-memes-in-advertising-perks-of-meme-marketing/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Can You Use Memes in Advertising? Perks of Meme Marketing </a></p>
<h3 aria-level="3"><span data-contrast="none">Interactive Presence </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:160,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}"> </span></h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Just regular posting will not be enough, one needs to engage with fellow audience. Interactive stories, polls and quizzes, contests and giveaways, etc. will engage followers and help more people respond and connect with your content. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Feature your interactive stories based on latest happenings or current situations to make them relatable and clear. However, customize those in a way that fits your brand purpose. This will engage the visitors, or current followers, and will also educate them about your brand and its purpose. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p aria-level="3"><span data-contrast="none">Utilize every social media channel effectively</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:160,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">“Not all the content you create may fit all your media channels”. Hence, understanding the strengths of each channel is essential. With every channel being different the type of content would also differ based on your audience, channel type, method or publishing rules. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">One can also track their progress through a variety of analytics tools for each platform. They help you monitor the type of content liked and engaged in by your audience offering a clearer picture. Analyzing it helps you track and create content simultaneously. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<h4><b><span data-contrast="auto">Example:</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></h4>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Instagram</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">&#8211; Instagram Insights, Hootsuite</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">LinkedIn</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">&#8211; LinkedIn Analytics, Sprout shoot</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Twitter</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">&#8211; Twitter Analytics, Hootsuite</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Facebook</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">&#8211; Facebook insights, Hootsuite</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"><b><span data-contrast="auto">Reddit-</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> Reddit Analytics </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<h2 aria-level="2"><span data-contrast="none">Conclusion </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:160,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}"> </span></h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">With the changing market dynamics, one needs to keep up with evolution and current trends to follow along. Understanding social media on a deeper level is crucial, especially when using it for your brand’s promotion and creating an identity and marking its online presence.  </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto"><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Impulse Digital</a> is also an Employer branding agency, which means we provide creative approach and strategic branding solutions to elevate your brand’s reputation in the wider competitive market. We collaborate with various brands helping them form a strong employer branding, attracting more purpose and demand tailored to your brand. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Want to know more? Connect with us on: </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/contact-us"><span data-contrast="none">https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/contact-us</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
